<title>FRANCE: GEC Alsthom signs agreement to buy Leroux et Lotz.</title>
<headline>GEC Alsthom signs agreement to buy Leroux et Lotz.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>GEC Alsthom has signed a preliminary agreement with the French group Leroux et Lotz to acquire its shipyards in the western towns of Lorient and Saint Malo.</p>
<p>The agreement also concerns engineering and design facilities in the Paris area. The deal is to be finalised by 30 November 1997 at the latest.</p>
<p>The acquisition will strengthen GEC Alsthom's shipbuilding activity, Chantiers de l'Atlantique, by extending its scope of supply to include high-speed car ferries and other special ships.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom 331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
